      "change": "release-added",
      "version": "2.0.1",
      "channel": "stable",
      "date": "2026-10-23",
      "status": "available",
      "notes": {
        "summary": "vfstool ships as a program again: `jess install org.dreamweave.vfstool`, or a download that runs without jess for Windows, macOS and Linux.",
        "added": [
          "The release carries vfstool as an application: `vfstool.jsw`, the package and everything it runs packed into one file, which `jess install org.dreamweave.vfstool` installs onto your PATH.",
          "A standalone `vfstool` for Windows x86_64, macOS x86_64 and ARM64, and Linux x86_64: jess carrying vfstool, zipped, needing nothing installed."
        ],
        "fixed": [
          "`vfstool help`, `--help` and `-h` print the commands and options instead of a note about the test suite, and running vfstool with no command points at them."
        ],
        "known_issues": [
          "vfstool doesn't look for `openmw.cfg` in OpenMW's default location: name it, or the folder holding it, with `--config` or `OPENMW_CONFIG`."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
